# Desktop: the opening Learn grid, keyboard selection, a mark, pause and resume (key and button), the Settings
# dialog (account section, Options button, Close), mute, a mode switch with restart and clear, then a solve by
# hints to the results breakdown and a new round.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 300 Mistakes 0
frames 150
save menus-start
expect No cell selected.
key ArrowUp 1
frames 3
expect Cell row 5, column 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 3
expect Cell row 5, column 6
key KeyP 1
frames 5
until 30 Press P or click Resume to continue.
save menus-paused
click =Resume
frames 10
key KeyP 1
frames 5
click =Settings
until 60 Sign in with StarHermit
expect Options: graphics, sound, language, controls
save menus-settings
click =Close
frames 10
click =Resume
frames 10
click Mute (M)
frames 5
expect Unmute (M)
key KeyM 1
frames 5
expect Mute (M)
click =Journey
frames 10
expect Medium
click Restart (R)
frames 10
expect Medium
repeat 600 until Sanctuary complete
  key KeyH 1
  frames 1
end
frames 20
expect Hints (
expect Total
expect Press R for a new round.
expect Best
save menus-results
key KeyR 1
frames 10
expect Medium
key KeyC 1
frames 5
expect Score 0
